      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8468823::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing enhances diffusion of Co and Cr to the coating surface.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-deposited FeNiCrCoCu coating has a mixed microstructure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-deposited coating lacks a fully developed surface oxide layer.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing near 800 °C promotes formation of a dense oxide scale.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8468823::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealing-induced oxide scale is adherent.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide scale becomes enriched in Co and Cr through thermally activated diffusion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Co contributes to improved high-temperature oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8468823::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense oxide layer acts as a barrier against further oxidative attack.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8468823::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective oxide layer acts as a barrier against abrasive wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealed coating will have a lower wear rate than the as-deposited coating.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealed coating will exhibit less oxide-scale spallation than the as-deposited coating.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The annealed coating will retain better surface integrity during high-temperature wear.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed mechanism is applicable to wear near 800 °C.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
